DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx-api.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx-infra.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx-pub.com

# CDN 与前端静态资源加载
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okxstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx-cdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okxstatic.cn

